_olex2_refinement_description
;
1. Fixed Uiso
 At 1.2 times of:
  All C(H) groups, All N(H) groups
 At 1.5 times of:
  All C(H,H,H) groups
2. Restrained distances
 O4-C9 \\sim O4A-C9A
 with sigma of 0.02
 C9-C10 \\sim C9A-C10A
 with sigma of 0.02
 O4-C10 \\sim O4A-C10A
 with sigma of 0.04
3. Restrained planarity
 O4, O4_$2, C9, C10
 with sigma of 0.1
 O4A_$2, O4A_$8, C9A_$8, C10A_$8
 with sigma of 0.1
4. Uiso/Uaniso restraints and constraints
All non-hydrogen atoms have similar U: within 2A with sigma of 0.04 and sigma
for terminal atoms of 0.08 within 2A
5. Rigid body (RIGU) restrains
 O3, N1, C1, C2, C3, C4, C5, C6, C7, C8
 with sigma for 1-2 distances of 0.004 and sigma for 1-3 distances of 0.004
 Zr1, O1, O3, O2, O4, C9, C10, O4A, C9A, C10A, O2A
 with sigma for 1-2 distances of 0.004 and sigma for 1-3 distances of 0.004
6. Others
 Sof(O4A)=1-FVAR(1)
 Sof(C9A)=Sof(C10A)=Sof(H10D)=Sof(H10E)=Sof(H10F)=0.5*(1-FVAR(2))
 Sof(C9)=Sof(C10)=Sof(H10A)=Sof(H10B)=Sof(H10C)=0.5*FVAR(2)
 Sof(O4)=FVAR(1)
 Sof(O2A)=0.5*(1-FVAR(3))
 Sof(O2)=0.5*FVAR(3)
 Fixed Sof: H1(0.25)
7.a Aromatic/amide H refined with riding coordinates:
 N1(H1), C3(H3), C4(H4), C8(H8)
7.b Idealised Me refined as rotating group:
 C10(H10A,H10B,H10C), C10A(H10D,H10E,H10F)
;
_olex2_exptl_crystal_mounting_method
;
In a solvent-free, dinitrogen-filled glovebox, activated crystals were coated 
with Paratone-N oil. The crystals were removed from the glovebox. A suitable 
single crystal was mounted on a MiTeGen loop, and cooled under a stream of N2 
at 100 K for collection.
;
